{"3488710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Race Wars", "steam_appid": 3488710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Wars is a modern take on Retro top down racers. You and up to 5 other racers hit the track in your selected vehicle and battle it out. Circuit racing, Drag racing, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around the idea that arcade games feel too &quot;arcade&quot;, but sim games can be quite time consuming to get into. This game takes sim like physics and puts them in a pickup arcade racer that is best enjoyed either with friends, or a never ending time trial session where you race to find that last tenth.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Wars is a modern take on Retro top down racers. You and up to 5 other racers hit the track in your selected vehicle and battle it out. Circuit racing, Drag racing, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around the idea that arcade games feel too &quot;arcade&quot;, but sim games can be quite time consuming to get into. This game takes sim like physics and puts them in a pickup arcade racer that is best enjoyed either with friends, or a never ending time trial session where you race to find that last tenth.</p>", "short_description": "Trying to recapture the fun of arcade racing with physics that make sense to sim racers. A Heli chase cam style with a sense of freedom, designed to capture the atmosphere of racing door to door. Race your mates around various environments or do time trial to set the fastest time...in the world", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488710/24e46b9af8e779ecf4b9de48f16f64ad6dc57788/header.jpg?t=1768960483", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488710/eff1fe8395c6068b34b951f325e0f8585